HDF5 Software Library (3-clause BSD)

The following portions of src/filter.rs are derived from the HDF5 Software
Library and Utilities:

- Atomic n-bit decompression: H5Z__nbit_decompress_one_atomic and
  H5Z__nbit_decompress_one_byte in src/H5Znbit.c (decode_nbit,
  nbit_one_atomic, nbit_one_byte).
- Little-endian integer scale-offset unpack: H5Z__scaleoffset_decompress_one_atomic
  and H5Z__scaleoffset_decompress_one_byte in src/H5Zscaleoffset.c
  (decode_scaleoffset, so_one_atomic, so_one_byte). The big-endian arm of
  the HDF5 function is not included.
- Fletcher32, including the checksum HDF5 accepts for files written before
  release 1.6.3: H5_checksum_fletcher32 in src/H5checksum.c and
  H5Z__filter_fletcher32 in src/H5Zfletcher32.c (fletcher32,
  check_fletcher32, reversed_fletcher).

